From 68171518924482266910673e2b43e47d7986a958 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:59:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: click a written text to edit it

A click (no drag) on a written text, with the pointer or the text tool,
reopens it in the text tool: cursor at the end, its colour, size and
size factor shown in the toolbars so they edit it. Enter or a click
elsewhere commits it in place of the original (one undo step), Escape
leaves the original as it was, and emptying it deletes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
